#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:1
msgid "HM-D13-LoRa"
msgstr "HM-D13-LoRa"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:3
msgid "产品定位"
msgstr "Product overview"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:6
msgid ""
"**面向固定区域和无公网作业的双频 RTK 定位套件。** D13 LoRa 移动站采用紧凑型一"
"体化设计，套件包含配套专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件及附件。"
msgstr ""
"**A dual-band RTK GNSS base-and-rover kit for fixed-area operations without "
"public network access.** The D13 LoRa rover uses a compact all-in-one "
"design, and the kit includes a dedicated D13 LoRa base station and "
"accessories."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:9
msgid "HM-D13-LoRa 移动站与配套 D13 LoRa 基站"
msgstr "HM-D13-LoRa rover with its D13 LoRa base station"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:14
msgid "核心价值"
msgstr "Key benefits"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:16
msgid "**本地自建差分链路**：不依赖公网、流量卡或 CORS 账号。"
msgstr ""
"**Self-contained correction link**: Requires no public network, SIM card/"
"data plan, or CORS account."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:17
msgid "**出厂默认配对**：基站和移动站上电自动连接，减少现场通信配置。"
msgstr ""
"**Factory-paired**: The base station and rover connect automatically at "
"power-on, minimizing on-site setup."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:18
msgid ""
"**适合稳定地面安装**：移动站集成 GNSS 天线、定位计算单元与 LoRa 通信链路，外"
"部只需连接 5-pin GH1.25 mm 接口。"
msgstr ""
"**Designed for stable ground installation**: The rover integrates the GNSS "
"antenna, positioning engine, and LoRa correction link, leaving only the 5-"
"pin GH1.25 mm interface to connect externally."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:19
msgid "**支持多移动站协同**：一个基站可一对一或一对多服务移动站。"
msgstr ""
"**Supports multiple rovers**: One base station can serve one or multiple "
"rovers."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:21
msgid "工作方式"
msgstr "How it works"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:23
msgid ""
"![HM-D13-LoRa移动站与D13基站组成差分系统](../images/scenarios/d13-lora-ref."
"png)"
msgstr ""
"![HM-D13-LoRa Rover and D13 Base Station Form an RTK Correction System](../"
"images/scenarios/d13-lora-ref.png)"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:23
msgid "HM-D13-LoRa移动站与D13基站组成差分系统"
msgstr "HM-D13-LoRa rover and D13 base station form an RTK correction system"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:25
msgid ""
"D13 基站固定接收卫星信号，通过内部 LoRa 链路向 D13 移动站发送差分数据；移动站"
"完成 RTK 解算后，通过 5-pin GH1.25 mm 接口向外部设备输出定位结果。"
msgstr ""
"The D13 base station continuously receives satellite signals and sends "
"correction data to the D13 rover via an internal LoRa link; after the rover "
"completes RTK solution computation, it outputs the positioning results to "
"external devices through a 5-pin GH1.25 mm interface."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:27
msgid "交付组成"
msgstr "Package contents"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:29
msgid "HM-D13-LoRa 移动站。"
msgstr "HM-D13-LoRa rover."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:30
msgid "配套专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件。"
msgstr "A dedicated D13 LoRa base station hardware."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:31
msgid "移动站配套 5-pin 接口线缆和兼容 3.3 V UART I/O 的 USB 转 UART 转接器。"
msgstr ""
"The rover includes a 5-pin interface cable and a USB-to-UART adapter "
"compatible with 3.3 V UART I/O."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:32
msgid ""
"基站配套外置 LoRa 天线和封装好的 4-pin USB 线缆；安装配件以装箱清单为准。"
msgstr ""
"The base station includes an external LoRa antenna and a sealed 4-pin USB "
"cable. Refer to the packing list for mounting accessories."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:35
msgid ""
"套件边界 专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件**仅随 LoRa 套件提供**，不单独销售，也不作为移"
"动站使用。"
msgstr ""
"Kit scope: The dedicated D13 LoRa base station **is supplied only with the "
"LoRa kit**. It is not sold separately and cannot be used as a rover."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:38
