msgstr "Rover: Φ152 × 67.9 mm / 236 g; base station: Φ152 × 67.9 mm / 515 g"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:56
msgid "完整 GNSS、环境和动态参数请查看[产品对比与资料](../comparison.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Product Comparison and Resources](../comparison.md) for complete GNSS, "
"environmental, and dynamic specifications."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:58
msgid "外部接口"
msgstr "Interfaces"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:60
msgid ""
"**D13 移动站 5-pin GH1.25 mm**：供电、3.3 V UART 和 3.3 V PPS 信号，按固定 "
"Pin 顺序连接。"
msgstr ""
"**D13 rover 5-pin GH1.25 mm**: Power, 3.3 V UART, and 3.3 V PPS; connect "
"strictly by pin number."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:61
msgid ""
"**D13 基站 USB 线缆**：对外仅使用封装好的 4-pin USB 线缆；连接 USB 电源可直接"
"供电，连接电脑时可进行 USB 串口通信。"
msgstr ""
"**D13 base-station USB cable**: The sealed 4-pin USB cable is the only "
"external cable. Connect it to a USB power source for power, or to a computer "
"for power and serial communication."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:62
msgid "**D13 基站通信天线接口**：连接基站外置 LoRa 天线。"
msgstr ""
"**D13 base-station communication antenna connector**: Connect the external "
"LoRa antenna."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:64
msgid "适用场景与前提"
msgstr "Applications and requirements"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:66
msgid "适合测绘、精准农业、园区机器人、智能驾驶测试和固定区域多终端作业。"
msgstr ""
"Suitable for surveying, precision agriculture, site robots, autonomous-"
"driving tests, and multi-rover operations in fixed areas."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d13-lora.md:69
msgid ""
"LoRa 现场边界 基站应在开阔位置稳定架设，**上电后不得移动**；同一局部场景只使"
"用一个基站。"
msgstr ""
"LoRa operating requirement: Install the base station securely with an open "
"sky view and **do not move it after power-on**. Use only one base station in "
"the local operating area."

